{
  "name": "formatString · 转义 \\${ 输出字面量",
  "description": "使用 \\${ 转义序列输出字面量 ${...}，与实际的路径插值 ${/user/name} 并列展示。规范 §formatString syntax：'To include a literal ${ in a string, it must be escaped as \\${'。",
  "messages": [
